  "questions": [
    {
      "id": "q682-order",
      "source_numbers": [
        "682"
      ],
      "view": {
        "mode": "multiple",
        "stem": "哪些比较成立？",
        "figure_ids": [],
        "options": [
          {
            "id": "A",
            "text": "$2^{6/7}<2^{7/8}$",
            "figure_ids": []
          },
          {
            "id": "B",
            "text": "$2^{\\sqrt3}>2^{\\sqrt7}$",
            "figure_ids": []
          },
          {
            "id": "C",
            "text": "$2^{-\\sqrt5}<2^{-\\sqrt3}$",
            "figure_ids": []
          },
          {
            "id": "D",
            "text": "$2^{\\sqrt3}<2^{\\sqrt7}$",
            "figure_ids": []
          },
          {
            "id": "E",
            "text": "$2^{6/7}=2^{7/8}$",
            "figure_ids": []
          }
        ]
      },
      "intent": {
        "task": "682: Task: compare three exponential pairs. Since 6/7 < 7/8,",
        "source_solution": "682. Task: compare three exponential pairs. Since 6/7 < 7/8,\nsqrt(3)<sqrt(7), and -sqrt(5)<-sqrt(3), all three first expressions\nare smaller than their second expressions. Increasing base 2 preserves\nthe order even for negative irrational exponents.",
        "unit_reason": "三组指数的有序性组成同一比较任务；多选保留分数、根式和负指数三个关键区别。",
        "concept_blocks": [],
        "limitations": [
          "选择只能显示识别与判断，不能证明学习者能独立写出推导或结果。"
        ],
        "figure_observations": []
      },
      "key": {
        "correct": [
          "A",
          "C",
          "D"
        ],
        "rationales": [
          {
            "option_id": "A",
            "truth": "correct",
            "derivation": "6/7<7/8，底数2递增。",
            "misconception": null
          },
          {
            "option_id": "B",
            "truth": "incorrect",
            "derivation": "sqrt3<sqrt7，故关系应为小于。",
            "misconception": "把根号内较小的数当作产生较大的指数，再按递增性比较。"
          },
          {
            "option_id": "C",
            "truth": "correct",
            "derivation": "-sqrt5<-sqrt3，递增性不因指数为负而改变。",
            "misconception": null
          },
          {
            "option_id": "D",
            "truth": "correct",
            "derivation": "正平方根保序且底数2>1。",
            "misconception": null
          },
          {
            "option_id": "E",
            "truth": "incorrect",
            "derivation": "6*8=48而7*7=49，指数不相等。",
            "misconception": "只看两个分数的分子都比分母少1，误认为分数相同。"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "q683-constants",
      "source_numbers": [
        "683"
      ],
      "view": {
        "mode": "single",
        "stem": "把 $2^{-100},2^{0.0001},2^{-\\sqrt3},2^{\\sqrt5},2^{2-\\sqrt2},2^{1-\\sqrt3}$ 依次与 $1$ 比较。哪一列关系完全正确？",
        "figure_ids": [],
        "options": [
          {
            "id": "A",
            "text": "$<,\\ >,\\ <,\\ >,\\ <,\\ >$",
            "figure_ids": []
          },
          {
            "id": "B",
            "text": "$<,\\ >,\\ <,\\ >,\\ >,\\ <$",
            "figure_ids": []
          },
          {
            "id": "C",
            "text": "$>,\\ >,\\ >,\\ >,\\ >,\\ >$",
            "figure_ids": []
          },
          {
            "id": "D",
            "text": "$<,\\ =,\\ <,\\ >,\\ >,\\ <$",
            "figure_ids": []
          }
        ]
      },
      "intent": {
        "task": "683: Task: compare eight expressions with 1, including variable cases.",
        "source_solution": "683. Task: compare eight expressions with 1, including variable cases.\na<1, b>1, c<1, d>1, e>1 (2-sqrt(2)>0), f<1 (1-sqrt(3)<0).\nFor g, 2^x is below/equal/above 1 as x<0 / x=0 / x>0.\nFor h, 2^(1-x) is below/equal/above 1 as x>1 / x=1 / x<1.\nDo not fix x to obtain a single comparison.",
        "unit_reason": "一个完整符号分类保留全部六项，不把每项改成单独数值点击。",
        "concept_blocks": [],
        "limitations": [
          "选择只能显示识别与判断，不能证明学习者能独立写出推导或结果。"
        ],
        "figure_observations": []
      },
      "key": {
        "correct": [
          "B"
        ],
        "rationales": [
          {
            "option_id": "A",
            "truth": "incorrect",
            "derivation": "末两指数实际一正一负。",
            "misconception": "把2-sqrt2与1-sqrt3的符号误由根号项的大小单独决定。"
          },
          {
            "option_id": "B",
            "truth": "correct",
            "derivation": "六个指数的符号依次负、正、负、正、正、负；与2^0比较。",
            "misconception": null
          },
          {
            "option_id": "C",
            "truth": "incorrect",
            "derivation": "负指数产生0与1之间的数。",
            "misconception": "从底数2>1错误推出任意指数的幂都>1。"
          },
          {
            "option_id": "D",
            "truth": "incorrect",
            "derivation": ".0001仍严格大于0。",
            "misconception": "把很小但非零的指数四舍五入为0。"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "q683-variable",
      "source_numbers": [
        "683"
      ],
      "view": {
        "mode": "single",
        "stem": "对任意实数 $x$，哪一项完整描述了 $2^x$ 和 $2^{1-x}$ 与 $1$ 的关系？",
        "figure_ids": [],
        "options": [
          {
            "id": "A",
            "text": "$2^x$ 在 $x<0,=0,>0$ 时依次为 $<1,=1,>1$；$2^{1-x}$ 在 $x<1,=1,>1$ 时也依次为 $<1,=1,>1$。",
            "figure_ids": []
          },
          {
            "id": "B",
            "text": "两式都在 $x<0,=0,>0$ 时依次为 $<1,=1,>1$。",
            "figure_ids": []
          },
          {
            "id": "C",
            "text": "$2^x$ 在 $x<0,=0,>0$ 时依次为 $<1,=1,>1$；$2^{1-x}$ 在 $x<1,=1,>1$ 时依次为 $>1,=1,<1$。",
            "figure_ids": []
          },
          {
            "id": "D",
            "text": "$2^x>1$ 且 $2^{1-x}>1$ 对所有 $x$ 都成立。",
            "figure_ids": []
          }
        ]
      },
      "intent": {
        "task": "683: Task: compare eight expressions with 1, including variable cases.",
        "source_solution": "683. Task: compare eight expressions with 1, including variable cases.\na<1, b>1, c<1, d>1, e>1 (2-sqrt(2)>0), f<1 (1-sqrt(3)<0).\nFor g, 2^x is below/equal/above 1 as x<0 / x=0 / x>0.\nFor h, 2^(1-x) is below/equal/above 1 as x>1 / x=1 / x<1.\nDo not fix x to obtain a single comparison.",
        "unit_reason": "两个可变指数各自有三个分支，使用完整条件陈述避免默默给x赋值。",
        "concept_blocks": [],
        "limitations": [
          "选择只能显示识别与判断，不能证明学习者能独立写出推导或结果。"
        ],
        "figure_observations": []
      },
      "key": {
        "correct": [
          "C"
        ],
        "rationales": [
          {
            "option_id": "A",
            "truth": "incorrect",
            "derivation": "第二函数随x递减，其第一和第三关系颠倒。",
            "misconception": "识别底数2递增后，忽略指数1-x随x递减。"
          },
          {
            "option_id": "B",
            "truth": "incorrect",
            "derivation": "第二式等于1的阈值是1而非0。",
            "misconception": "套用2^x的三分规则而不解1-x=0。"
          },
          {
            "option_id": "C",
            "truth": "correct",
            "derivation": "分别检查x和1-x与0的关系，含全部等号边界。",
            "misconception": null
          },
          {
            "option_id": "D",
            "truth": "incorrect",
            "derivation": "x=-1使第一式<1，x=2使第二式<1。",
            "misconception": "把底数大于1误当成幂大于1的充分条件，省略指数范围。"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "q684-images",
      "source_numbers": [
        "684"
      ],
      "view": {
        "mode": "multiple",
        "stem": "令 $f(x)=2^x$。下列关于区间像的陈述，哪些正确？",
        "figure_ids": [],
        "options": [
          {
            "id": "A",
            "text": "$f((0,+\\infty))=(1,+\\infty)$，$f((-\\infty,0))=(0,1)$。",
            "figure_ids": []
          },
          {
            "id": "B",
            "text": "$f((1,5))=(2,32)$。",
            "figure_ids": []
          },
          {
            "id": "C",
            "text": "$f([-1,1])=[-2,2]$。",
            "figure_ids": []
          },
          {
            "id": "D",
            "text": "$f([-1,1])=[1/2,2]$，$f([0,1])=[1,2]$。",
            "figure_ids": []
          },
          {
            "id": "E",
            "text": "$f((-\\infty,0))=[0,1)$。",
            "figure_ids": []
          }
        ]
      },
      "intent": {
        "task": "684: Task: image sets with endpoint topology.",
        "source_solution": "684. Task: image sets with endpoint topology.\na (1,infinity); b (0,1); c (2,32); d [1/2,2]; e [1,2].\nStrict monotonicity transports finite endpoints, retains their open/closed\nstatus, and an unattained horizontal asymptote does not become an endpoint.",
        "unit_reason": "按无穷开区间、有限开区间和闭区间组织像集合，不拆成五个端点填空。",
        "concept_blocks": [],
        "limitations": [
          "选择只能显示识别与判断，不能证明学习者能独立写出推导或结果。"
        ],
        "figure_observations": []
      },
      "key": {
        "correct": [
          "A",
          "B",
          "D"
        ],
        "rationales": [
          {
            "option_id": "A",
            "truth": "correct",
            "derivation": "严格递增，零点值1和水平渐近值0均未取得。",
            "misconception": null
          },
          {
            "option_id": "B",
            "truth": "correct",
            "derivation": "端点2和32均不取得。",
            "misconception": null
          },
          {
            "option_id": "C",
            "truth": "incorrect",
            "derivation": "2^-1=1/2而非-2。",
            "misconception": "将负指数看成把函数值取负。"
          },
          {
            "option_id": "D",
            "truth": "correct",
            "derivation": "有限闭区间的端点值都取得，且函数递增。",
            "misconception": null
          },
          {
            "option_id": "E",
            "truth": "incorrect",
            "derivation": "2^x永不为0。",
            "misconception": "把趋于0当成在某个有限x达到0。"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "q685-inverse",
      "source_numbers": [
        "685"
      ],
      "view": {
        "mode": "single",
        "stem": "方程 $2^x=32,\\ 2^x=1/64,\\ 2^x=0.5,\\ 2^x=0.25,\\ 2^x=0.125,\\ 2^x=128$ 的根，按这个次序组成哪一列？",
