      "intent": {
        "task": "687: Task: compare two pairs of vertical changes from the graph.",
        "source_solution": "687. Task: compare two pairs of vertical changes from the graph.\nFor width h>0, delta at starting x=t is 2^t(2^h-1).\na later interval [1.5,2.5] has twice the change of [.5,1.5].\nb later interval [1.2,1.7] has twice the change of [.2,.7].\nBoth are vertical changes, not final heights or slopes at isolated points.\nAn actual graph must remain available; algebra alone loses the requested route.",
        "unit_reason": "两组同宽但不同起点的增量形成一个图形比较任务；必须看实际图，不改成单纯终值比较。",
        "concept_blocks": [],
