          }
        ]
      },
      "intent": {
        "task": "694: Task: three comparisons using reciprocals.",
        "source_solution": "694. Task: three comparisons using reciprocals.\na .04^-5=25^5 <25^6; b (2/3)^-6=(3/2)^6=1.5^6;\nc .5^-11=2^11. A negative exponent reciprocates the base, not the value's sign.",
        "unit_reason": "三个倒数幂比较共同考查底数转换，不逐个提示转换后的答案。",
        "concept_blocks": [],
        "limitations": [
