            "text": "若 $0.3^k=100$，则 $k>0$。",
            "figure_ids": []
          }
        ]
      },
      "intent": {
        "task": "697: Task: infer the signs of four exponents.",
        "source_solution": "697. Task: infer the signs of four exponents.\na positive, b negative, c positive, d negative. Compare RHS with 1;\nthen use base monotonicity. The magnitude 1.003 being near 1 does not make k zero.",
        "unit_reason": "把两类底数组织成符号判断，不要求不必要的对数近似。",
        "concept_blocks": [],
        "limitations": [
