            "text": "$0.4^x=6\\frac14$ 的根是 $2$。",
            "figure_ids": []
          }
        ]
      },
      "intent": {
        "task": "700: Task: six root sets.",
        "source_solution": "700. Task: six root sets.\na 3^x=3^-2/3 gives {-2/3}.\nb .4^x=(2/5)^x=25/4=(2/5)^-2 gives {-2}.\nc 7^x=7^-1/5 gives {-1/5}.\nd (.8*1.25)^10=1 gives {0}.\ne .2^x=5^-x=5^3 gives {-3}.\nf 6^(x^2-1)=1 implies x^2-1=0, roots {-1,1}.",
        "unit_reason": "倒数根式、有限小数和单位积按数学结构分组，但每个原方程都给出可确定的完整根。",
        "concept_blocks": [],
        "limitations": [
          "选择只能显示识别与判断，不能证明学习者能独立写出推导或结果。"
