      "intent": {
        "task": "701: Task: six inequalities.",
        "source_solution": "701. Task: six inequalities.\na x>3/2; b x<2/3; c x>-1/2;\nd .7^x>100/49=.7^-2 implies x<-2;\ne .2^x<25=.2^-2 implies x>-2;\nf (1/3)^x>(1/3)^(2/3) implies x<2/3.\nAll bounds are strict; bases below 1 reverse order.",
        "unit_reason": "成对结果覆盖六个独立不等式，重点比较底数范围、根指数及严格端点，而非每个答槽独立点击。",
        "concept_blocks": [],
