      "intent": {
        "task": "702: Task: four exponent-linear equations.",
        "source_solution": "702. Task: four exponent-linear equations.\na 5x=-7 => -7/5.\nb (-2x)=-3 for base .5 => x=3/2 (equivalently 2^(2x)=2^-3?\nCorrection of the alternate conversion: .5^(-2x)=2^(2x), .125=2^-3,\nso 2x=-3 and x=-3/2. The direct base-.5 exponent of .125 is +3,\nso -2x=3. Final independent result b=-3/2.)\nc 3x=0 =>0. d 7x=2 =>2/7.\nThe retained correction records the original independent arithmetic fault;\nthe final result is checked by substitution, not by an answer file.",
        "unit_reason": "同底转换后的完整根列；负底数倒数转换与单位右端都有独立数学意义。",
        "concept_blocks": [],
        "limitations": [
          "选择只能显示识别与判断，不能证明学习者能独立写出推导或结果。"
        ],
        "figure_observations": []
      },
      "key": {
        "correct": [
          "B"
        ],
        "rationales": [
          {
            "option_id": "A",
            "truth": "incorrect",
            "derivation": "第二式应-2x=3。",
            "misconception": "化.125为2^-3，却保留.5的指数-2x不作底数转换，得到错号。"
          },
          {
            "option_id": "B",
            "truth": "correct",
            "derivation": "比较同底指数：5x=-7，-2x=3，3x=0，7x=2。",
            "misconception": null
          },
          {
            "option_id": "C",
            "truth": "incorrect",
            "derivation": "未知指数中的乘数应除掉，不应再乘。",
            "misconception": "把5x=-7,-2x=3,7x=2中的系数继续相乘作为x。"
          },
          {
            "option_id": "D",
            "truth": "incorrect",
