      "intent": {
        "task": "703: Task: ten exponential equations.",
        "source_solution": "703. Task: ten exponential equations.\na 2^(x/2)=2^10 =>20.\nb 10^(x/2)*10^-1=10^3 =>8.\nc 2^(6x-2)=2^(6x-15) would require -2=-15; no roots.\nd 2^(4x-2)=2^(70-5x) =>x=8.\ne 10^x=10^-3 =>-3.\nf 6^x=6^3 =>3.\ng 10^(x-1)=10^-3 =>-2.\nh 28^(1-x)=28^-1 =>2.\ni (sqrt(12)*sqrt(3))^x=6^x=6^-1 =>-1.\nj (sqrt(14))^(x-1)=1 =>1.\nThe impossible c is an essential distinction, not a missing numeric blank.",
        "unit_reason": "两个根式指数的等价转换一起判断，避免只看右端幂指数。",
        "concept_blocks": [],
        "limitations": [
