      "intent": {
        "task": "706: Task: four factorizable sums.",
        "source_solution": "706. Task: four factorizable sums.\na (1+4)2^x=20 =>2^x=4 =>2.\nb (1+3)3^x=12 =>3^x=3 =>1.\nc (5+1)5^(x-1)=30 =>5^(x-1)=5 =>2.\nd (1+4+16)4^(x-1)=84 =>4^(x-1)=4 =>2.\nAddition of exponentials is factored, never handled as addition of exponents.",
        "unit_reason": "四式以提公因式为共同数学行动，一次识别完整解列，不提示中间幂值。",
        "concept_blocks": [],
        "limitations": [
