    {
      "id": "q707-forward-domain",
      "source_numbers": [
        "707"
      ],
      "view": {
        "mode": "multiple",
        "stem": "这里显式取序列下标 $n=1,2,\\ldots$，并把等比定义为存在固定实数 $r$，使 $u_{n+1}=r u_n$；不要求各项非零。关于表示 $u_n=c a^n$ 的论断，哪些成立？",
        "figure_ids": [],
        "options": [
          {
            "id": "A",
            "text": "若 $r\\ne0$，取 $a=r,\\ c=u_1/r$ 就能表示全部项，负公比也适用。",
            "figure_ids": []
          },
          {
            "id": "B",
            "text": "序列 $1,0,0,\\ldots$ 满足上述等比定义，但不能用有限实数 $c,a$ 写成 $u_n=c a^n$。",
            "figure_ids": []
          },
          {
            "id": "C",
            "text": "所有符合这里定义的序列都能用 $a=0$ 表示。",
            "figure_ids": []
          },
          {
            "id": "D",
            "text": "只要 $r<0$，在整数下标上就不可能使用 $a=r$。",
            "figure_ids": []
          }
        ]
      },
      "intent": {
        "task": "707: Task: prove both directions of a geometric/exponential correspondence.",
        "source_solution": "707. Task: prove both directions of a geometric/exponential correspondence.\nThe approved modern erratum ca -> ca^x is already in the seed. It does not\nsettle domains. For indexing n=1,2,... and r!=0, u_n=u_1 r^(n-1)\n=c a^n with a=r,c=u_1/r, including negative r on this integer domain.\nConversely u_n=c a^n satisfies u_(n+1)=a u_n for integer n>=1.\nFor a!=0 and c=0 this is the zero sequence, valid under the recurrence\ndefinition but adjacent quotients are undefined. For a=0 and n>=1 all\nterms are zero; a source geometric sequence (u_1!=0,0,0,...) cannot be\nrepresented by c*0^n with finite c. Thus an unrestricted 'any' in a is\nfalse under that recurrence definition and starting index.\nFor n=0,1,..., u_n=u_0 r^n, but r=0 needs an explicit 0^0 convention\nor a separate n=0 definition. Negative a is legitimate on integers but\nnot as an everywhere-defined real-exponent function; a>0,a!=1 belongs\nto the usual real exponential convention, not the unrestricted sequence claim.\nN's inclusion of zero and geometric-sequence nonzero-term requirements are\nabsent from seed. A substantive conditional validity/counterexample question\ncan be keyed only with its integer domain and recurrence definition visible.\nBoth unrestricted written proofs and resolution of the source convention\nremain unavailable; do not silently prove a restricted theorem as the original.",
        "unit_reason": "对原普遍证明做有实质内容的域和反例判断；新增定义与下标明确可见，不默证收窄的原命题。",
        "concept_blocks": [],
        "limitations": [
          "选择只能显示识别与判断，不能证明学习者能独立写出推导或结果。",
          "原文N是否含0和等比数列的非零要求未给定；原a方向的无条件证明未完成。",
          "选择有效映射与反例不能验证独立证明能力。"
        ],
        "figure_observations": []
      },
      "key": {
        "correct": [
          "A",
          "B"
        ],
        "rationales": [
          {
            "option_id": "A",
            "truth": "correct",
            "derivation": "u_n=u1*r^(n-1)=(u1/r)*r^n，整数指数允许负底数。",
            "misconception": null
          },
          {
            "option_id": "B",
            "truth": "correct",
            "derivation": "第一项非零要求ca=1，因此c,a都非零，第二项ca^2=a也非零，矛盾。",
            "misconception": null
          },
          {
            "option_id": "C",
            "truth": "incorrect",
            "derivation": "a=0在正整数下标给全零序列。",
            "misconception": "把公比0的第一项也错误写成u1*0^1，抹掉非零首项。"
          },
          {
            "option_id": "D",
            "truth": "incorrect",
            "derivation": "负底数的整数幂可定义，交替符号合法。",
            "misconception": "把实指数函数正底数限制未经区分地施加到整数下标序列。"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "q707-reverse-domain",
      "source_numbers": [
        "707"
      ],
      "view": {
        "mode": "multiple",
        "stem": "仍取 $n=1,2,\\ldots$，等比采用递推定义 $u_{n+1}=r u_n$。令 $u_n=c a^n$，其中 $a,c$ 为实数。哪些关于定义域与等比性质的判断成立？",
        "figure_ids": [],
        "options": [
