      "id": "q721-tiled-set",
      "source_numbers": [
        "721"
      ],
      "view": {
        "mode": "multiple",
        "stem": "约定 $[t]$ 是不大于实数 $t$ 的最大整数，$\\{t\\}=t-[t]$。 图 D 的方格规律对每个整数都继续重复；实线边界包含、虚线边界不包含，角点另以实心/空心标明。关于方程 $[x]=[y]$，哪些说法正确？",
        "figure_ids": [
          "fig-choice-floor-regions-FIRST"
        ],
        "options": [
          {
            "id": "A",
            "text": "解集是图 D 表示的 $\\displaystyle\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb Z}[n,n+1)\\times[n,n+1)$。",
            "figure_ids": []
          },
          {
            "id": "B",
            "text": "它的图像仅是直线 $y=x$。",
            "figure_ids": []
          },
          {
            "id": "C",
            "text": "$(0.2,0.8)$ 属于该图，且每个 $(n,n)$（$n$ 为整数）都属于。",
            "figure_ids": []
          },
          {
            "id": "D",
            "text": "只要 $|x-y|<1$，点就属于该图。",
            "figure_ids": []
          },
          {
            "id": "E",
            "text": "图 D 只保留方格边线，不保留方格内部。",
            "figure_ids": []
          }
        ]
      },
      "intent": {
        "task": "721: Task: plot floor(x)=floor(y).",
        "source_solution": "721. Task: plot floor(x)=floor(y).\nUnion over all n in Z of [n,n+1) x [n,n+1). Unit diagonal squares,\nnot just the line y=x and not the whole band |x-y|<1.\nLeft and bottom edges included; top and right excluded within each tile.\nAt every integer diagonal corner (n,n) the next tile includes that point.\nExample (.2,.8) qualifies, (.9,1.1) does not despite separation <1.\nA finite visible window must state the pattern repeats for all integer n.",
        "unit_reason": "实际二维阴影和半开边界是核心，保留不是直线也不是整条带的区别。",
        "concept_blocks": [],
