            "text": "$\\sqrt{0.42}=10^{2b}$。",
            "figure_ids": []
          },
          {
            "id": "D",
            "text": "$\\sqrt{0.42}=10^{b/2}$。",
            "figure_ids": []
          },
          {
            "id": "E",
            "text": "$(31.5)^{2/3}\\sqrt[5]{0.42}=10^{2a/3+b/5}$。",
