            "id": "F",
            "text": "$31.5\\cdot0.42=10^{ab}$。",
            "figure_ids": []
          }
        ]
      },
      "intent": {
        "task": "722: Task: four expressions as base-10 powers.",
        "source_solution": "722. Task: four expressions as base-10 powers.\na 10^(a+b); b 10^(3a); c 10^(b/2); d 10^(2a/3+b/5).\nThe original defines positive bases 31.5 and .42 so all real roots used\nhere are well-defined. Multiplication adds exponent contributions.",
        "unit_reason": "四种幂运算的确定断言统一判断，全部原数学目标保留。",
        "concept_blocks": [],
        "limitations": [
